sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as LoginUI
  participant API as AuthService
  participant Mail as EmailDispatcher
  UI->>API: POST /auth/login email+password
  alt No factor required
    Note over API: force OFF and no opt-in and no TOTP
    API-->>UI: JWT
  else TOTP enrolled
    API-->>UI: 401 LOGIN_2FA_REQUIRED method totp
    UI->>API: POST /auth/login email+password+code
    API-->>UI: JWT
  else Email factor required
    Note over API: force ON or email opt-in
    API->>Mail: login-2fa code
    API-->>UI: 401 LOGIN_2FA_REQUIRED method email
    UI->>API: POST /auth/login email+password+code
    API-->>UI: JWT
  end
